# Manus OAuth Configuration
# Get these from your Manus developer dashboard
VITE_APP_ID="<your_app_id>"
OAUTH_SERVER_URL="https://manus.computer"

# JWT Secret for session management
# Use a long, random string for security
JWT_SECRET="<your_random_jwt_secret>"

# Database Connection URL
# Example for a local MySQL database
DATABASE_URL="mysql://user:password@localhost:3306/lychee"

# The OpenID of the user who should have 'admin' privileges
OWNER_OPEN_ID="<your_manus_openid>"

# Manus Forge API Credentials for AI Features
# These are required for note classification
BUILT_IN_FORGE_API_URL="https://forge.manus.im"
BUILT_IN_FORGE_API_KEY="<your_forge_api_key>"

# The frontend also needs access to some of these for auth flow and maps
VITE_OAUTH_PORTAL_URL="https://manus.computer"
VITE_FRONTEND_FORGE_API_URL="https://api.manus.im/forge"
VITE_FRONTEND_FORGE_API_KEY="<your_forge_api_key>"


LYCHEE_ENV_TEMPLATE.md
# Lychee .env File - Complete Structure

```env
# ============================================================================
# DATABASE CONFIGURATION
# ============================================================================
DATABASE_URL=mysql://user:password@localhost:3306/lychee_db

# ============================================================================
# AUTHENTICATION & OAUTH (Manus Platform)
# ============================================================================
JWT_SECRET=your-secure-random-string-generated-with-openssl-rand-base64-32
VITE_APP_ID=your-manus-app-id
OAUTH_SERVER_URL=https://api.manus.im
VITE_OAUTH_PORTAL_URL=https://login.manus.im

# ============================================================================
# OWNER INFORMATION
# ============================================================================
OWNER_OPEN_ID=your-manus-user-open-id
OWNER_NAME=Your Name or Organization

# ============================================================================
# MANUS BUILT-IN APIS (LLM, Storage, Notifications)
# ============================================================================
BUILT_IN_FORGE_API_URL=https://api.manus.im/forge
BUILT_IN_FORGE_API_KEY=key_xyz789abc
VITE_FRONTEND_FORGE_API_URL=https://api.manus.im/forge
VITE_FRONTEND_FORGE_API_KEY=your-frontend-forge-api-key

# ============================================================================
# ANALYTICS (Optional)
# ============================================================================
VITE_ANALYTICS_ENDPOINT=https://analytics.manus.im
VITE_ANALYTICS_WEBSITE_ID=your-website-id

# ============================================================================
# APP BRANDING
# ============================================================================
VITE_APP_TITLE=Lychee - Intelligent Note Capture
VITE_APP_LOGO=/logo.svg

# ============================================================================
# CLASSIFICATION THRESHOLDS
# ============================================================================
CLASSIFICATION_THRESHOLD_HIGH=0.85
CLASSIFICATION_THRESHOLD_MEDIUM=0.6

# ============================================================================
# NODE ENVIRONMENT
# ============================================================================
NODE_ENV=development
```

## Variable Reference

| Variable | Purpose | Example |
|----------|---------|---------|
| `DATABASE_URL` | MySQL/TiDB connection string | `mysql://root:pass@localhost:3306/lychee` |
| `JWT_SECRET` | Session signing key (256+ bits) | `openssl rand -base64 32` output |
| `VITE_APP_ID` | Manus OAuth application ID | `app_123abc456def` |
| `OAUTH_SERVER_URL` | Manus OAuth server endpoint | `https://api.manus.im` |
| `VITE_OAUTH_PORTAL_URL` | Manus login portal | `https://login.manus.im` |
| `OWNER_OPEN_ID` | Your Manus user ID | `user_abc123xyz` |
| `OWNER_NAME` | Your name/organization | `John Doe` |
| `BUILT_IN_FORGE_API_URL` | Manus API gateway | `https://api.manus.im/forge` |
| `BUILT_IN_FORGE_API_KEY` | API authentication key | `key_xyz789abc` |
| `VITE_FRONTEND_FORGE_API_URL` | Frontend API gateway | `https://api.manus.im/forge` |
| `VITE_FRONTEND_FORGE_API_KEY` | Frontend API key | `key_frontend123` |
| `VITE_ANALYTICS_ENDPOINT` | Analytics service URL | `https://analytics.manus.im` |
| `VITE_ANALYTICS_WEBSITE_ID` | Website tracking ID | `site_123456` |
| `VITE_APP_TITLE` | App display name | `Lychee - Intelligent Note Capture` |
| `VITE_APP_LOGO` | Logo asset path | `/logo.svg` |
| `CLASSIFICATION_THRESHOLD_HIGH` | High confidence threshold | `0.85` |
| `CLASSIFICATION_THRESHOLD_MEDIUM` | Medium confidence threshold | `0.6` |
| `NODE_ENV` | Environment mode | `development` or `production` |

